{"4621810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Livin' the Cream: Ice Cream Simulator", "steam_appid": 4621810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5100290], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/4a78e3e20515fc5b2794d79dd93055d5.avif?t=1787464667\" width=1313 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the smooth, satisfying flow of ice cream in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/d09ebbaa79cf9c975c8c876d990a98ce.poster.avif?t=1787464667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/d09ebbaa79cf9c975c8c876d990a98ce.webm?t=1787464667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/d09ebbaa79cf9c975c8c876d990a98ce.mp4?t=1787464667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/fb04f0a9b9f3d8560a45119ddaa97a7d.avif?t=1787464667\" width=1313 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft delicious ice cream from scratch using fresh ingredients, mix flavors, and create the perfect texture. Turn simple ingredients into tasty, satisfying ice cream delights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/b4eaebb756d88a8722812cd6b4cee6a2.poster.avif?t=1787464667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://