\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/65e3511ee06b4fbbc305f43c7609823c.poster.avif?t=1787464667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/65e3511ee06b4fbbc305f43c7609823c.webm?t=1787464667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/65e3511ee06b4fbbc305f43c7609823c.mp4?t=1787464667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/fd8d5c63d185bcd7348380f1d467e311.avif?t=1787464667\" width=1500 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn an empty space into your dream ice cream shop. Customize your shop’s look and style to make it your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/7dbe2ea0ea206a1310863ad3ab541fa3.poster.avif?t=1787464667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/7dbe2ea0ea206a1310863ad3ab541fa3.webm?t=1787464667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/7dbe2ea0ea206a1310863ad3ab541fa3.mp4?t=1787464667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621810/extras/22ae76df8550105e236441d2a5f2a298.avif?t=1787464667\" width=1313 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy fresh ingredients from local markets, stock your shop, and keep your business ru